"The Libra is Aulia Velra's megayacht, which her grandson Lute calls her lair."
"Lute Velra lived aboard the Libra before moving out on his own."
"A Rabbit with Tailor Environment keeps the Libra arranged for Aulia."
"The Libra docks at North Point Marina."
"It has a glass-bottomed pool over a sitting room and a retractable lit roof."
"Its numbered cabins include one kept by Orpheus Velra; a piano was aboard for Lute."
"Its staff include Chef Kabir, a stewardess who makes beds without hands, and hull crew."
"Chef Kabir is a C-rank Longsight Brute who watches his pots through a viewpoint spell."
"Cabins are scarce; Lute's was next to Corin's, and some crew speak Artonan."
"The yacht isn't stabilized, so it rolls with the sea."
"With its magical modifications it is said to be worth more than all Aulia's other property."
"Aulia once moved the household offshore aboard the Libra to avoid her grandson Roman."
"A Wrightmade vault aboard, made by the Picklock, held Aulia's Submerger."
"Orpheus Velra stole the Submerger from the Libra and sold it, leading to the Matadero attack."
"The Libra survived the flood on the far side of Matadero."
"Aulia vowed to live at sea as far away as the law allows until the attack's mastermind is caught."
